         {% endfor %}</ul>
 
+    You can also provide a ``filter_groups`` callable to filter groups
+    after they are created. The callable receives the list of members
+    in each group and should return a truthy value to keep the group
+    or a falsy value to discard it.
+
+    .. sourcecode:: jinja
+
+        <ul>{% for city, items in users|groupby("city", filter_groups=lambda x: x|length > 1) %}
+          <li>{{ city }}: {{ items|length }} users</li>
+        {% endfor %}</ul>
+
+    .. versionchanged:: 3.1
+        Added the ``filter_groups`` parameter.
+
     .. versionchanged:: 3.0
         Added the ``default`` parameter.
 
